<view class="exception-page"><image class="exception-bg" src="/images/runtime/team-data-emerald-stadium-v1.jpg" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="exception-content"><view class="exception-nav"><text class="exception-back" bindtap="back">‹</text><text>球员资料异常</text></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="exception-loading">正在读取脱敏核验结果…</view><block wx:else><view class="exception-player"><text class="exception-avatar">{{player.avatarText}}</text><view><view><text>{{player.name}}</text><text class="exception-status">{{player.statusText}}</text></view><text>{{player.teamName}}</text><text>{{player.birthDate}}</text><view class="exception-tags"><text>赛小蜂 U12</text><text>长期球员资产</text></view></view></view><view class="exception-alert"><image src="/images/runtime/icons/brand-v2-13.png" mode="aspectFit"/><text>姓名与身份证核验结果不一致，请核对后由家长重新提交。</text></view><view class="exception-panel"><text class="exception-heading">资料检查</text><view wx:for="{{checks}}" wx:key="title" class="exception-check"><image src="{{item.icon}}" mode="aspectFit"/><view><text>{{item.title}}</text><text>{{item.detail}}</text></view><text class="{{item.className}}">{{item.state}}</text><text class="exception-arrow">›</text></view></view><view class="exception-panel"><text class="exception-heading">姓名与身份证核验对照（脱敏）</text><view class="exception-compare"><view><text>球队档案姓名</text><text>{{player.maskedName}}</text></view><view><text>证件识别姓名</text><text>{{player.verifiedName}}</text></view><view><text>身份证号</text><text>{{player.idMasked}}</text></view></view><text class="exception-private">🔒 主办方/球队不得查看身份证原图，仅用于核验比对。</text></view><view class="exception-panel exception-actions"><text class="exception-heading">操作</text><view><button wx:if="{{canManage}}" bindtap="remind">联系家长重新提交</button><button bindtap="viewLog">查看核验记录</button></view></view><view class="exception-panel"><text class="exception-heading">异常审计记录</text><view wx:for="{{audit}}" wx:key="label" class="exception-audit"><text class="{{item.className}}"></text><text>{{item.time}}</text><text>{{item.label}}</text><text>{{item.state}}</text></view></view></block></view></view>
